        "verdict": "absent",
        "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" xml:lang=\"en-GB\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <title>Opening hours and contact – Acme Hardware Berlin</title>\n    <style>\n        body { font: 16px/1.5 sans-serif; margin: 0 16px; }\n        a { display: inline-block; min-width: 44px; min-height: 44px; line-height: 44px; }\n        input, button { min-width: 44px; min-height: 44px; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <!-- Conforming look-alike for the structure rules (#783): every\n         structure the rules look at is present and correct. -->\n    <a href=\"#main\" class=\"skip-link\">Skip to content</a>\n    <header>\n        <p>Acme Hardware</p>\n    </header>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Main\">\n        <ul>\n            <li><a href=\"/\">Home</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"/shop/\">Shop</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"/contact/\">Contact</a></li>\n        </ul>\n    </nav>\n    <main id=\"main\">\n        <h1>Opening hours and contact</h1>\n        <p>Our store in Berlin is open six days a week. We are happy to help you\n           find the right tool for your project, and you can always call us before\n           you visit to check that an item is in stock.</p>\n        <h2>Opening hours</h2>\n        <dl>\n            <div><dt>Monday to Friday</dt><dd>8:00 to 18:00</dd></div>\n            <div><dt>Saturday</dt><dd>9:00 to 14:00</dd></div>\n        </dl>\n        <h2>Directions</h2>\n        <!-- English text with German proper names: names are exempt from\n             3.1.2, and only two German function words occur. -->\n        <p id=\"directions\">The store is a short walk from the Haus der Kunst gallery and the\n           old bridge that locals call die Brücke. Take the tram to the main square, then\n           follow the river for about five minutes until you see our green sign.</p>\n        <article>\n            <h3>Store news</h3>\n            <p>We now stock garden tools from local makers.</p>\n        </article>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"contact-heading\">\n            <h2 id=\"contact-heading\">Contact</h2>\n            <p>Call us or send a message. Prices include <abbr title=\"value-added tax\">VAT</abbr>.</p>\n            <form action=\"/contact\" method=\"post\">\n                <label for=\"contact-email\">E-mail</label>\n                <input id=\"contact-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" aria-describedby=\"contact-hint\">\n                <p id=\"contact-hint\">We reply within one working day.</p>\n                <button type=\"submit\">Send</button>\n            </form>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer>\n        <p>Acme Hardware, Berlin</p>\n    </footer>\n    <!-- Hidden leftover outside every landmark: not rendered, not content. -->\n    <div hidden>Summer sale banner</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
